�To gnosto muthistorema epokhes tes Daphnes Nti Morie se mia nea, sugkhrone kai glaphure metaphrase. E suggrapheas topothetei tous eroes tes sten agapemene tes Kornouale kai prosdidei sten ploke tou muthistorematos ten oikeia ainigmatike tes atmosphaira. Den dinei apanteseis. Aphenei ta sumperasmata stous anagnostes."�
�E sourealistike ekdokhe mias alethines istorias apo ton polemo perilambanei:
Ena beterano, ton Mpil Pilgkrim, pou taxideuei mesa sto khrono kai pephtei thuma apagoges apo exogeinous, to 1967.
Mia alexisphaire biblo dipla s' ena phulladio me titlo "Mathe ton ekhthro sou".
Enthousiodeis neosullektous, suneidetopoiemenous lipotaktes, gennaious anikhneutes, enedres tes sumphoras kai thuellodeis enagkalismous puron.
Ten upokhreotike xenagese-philoxene diamone aikhmaloton polemou sto Sphageio No 5 tes Dresdes.
Sex parousia koinou s' ena zoologiko kepo ston planete Tralphamantor.
Ena donete me ten onomasia ta Magika Dakhtula.
Ten anakoinose tou Trouman gia ten atomike bomba ste Khirosima.
To philodoxo ergo enos aprobleptou suggraphea me thema to bombardismo tes Dresdes kai aikhmes mia ta bombardismena muala tou semera.
Muthistorema khoris iero kai osio, sten empoleme zone tes anthropines istorias. Mia diakhronika epikaire satira tou anthropinou paralogismou kai patriotismou. Ergo pou kuklophorese to 1969, ena apo ta klasika antipolemika biblia kai e koruphaia demiourgia tou Kert Bonegkat."�
�E graphike Phielmpaka ekhei dokimastei sto parelthon apo tragodies, alla tipota den ten ekhei sugklonisei toso oso to ptoma enos mikrou koritsiou sta dikhtua enos psara. Ta apotelesmata tes nekropsias sokaroun - den prokeitai gia atukhema. O epitheoretes Patrik Khentstrem, pou molis ekhei ginei pateras, analambanei to thlibero kathekon na anakalupsei poios krubetai piso apo te methodeumene dolophonia enos paidiou, to opoio kai ekeinos kai e suntrophos tou e Erika gnorizan polu kala. Kserei pos e apantese brisketai sto giati. Den xerei omos oti aute e upothese tha ton odegesei se mia kataduse ston skoteino purena tes Phielmpaka kai sto parelthon tes poles, mia anadrome pou tha dialusei mia gia panta ten eidulliake tes opse."�
�Epi trianta ennia khronia o Mpartholomiou Nel ekhei zesei prostateumenos apo te metera tou. Otan ekeine pethainei, o Mpartholomiou kaleitai na parei te zoe tou sta kheria tou. Pos omos enas antras pou ole tou e poreia ekhei kathoristei apo te metera tou, ten Ekklesia kai tis episkepseis tou ste bibliotheke tha mporesei na stathei sta podia tou;
Prospathontas na antlesei kouragio kai autoektimese, o Mpartholomiou arkhizei na paizei ena paikhnidi me ton eauto tou prospoioumenos oti einai o Ritsarnt Gkir, o star ton opoio latreue e metera tou, kai na moirazetai aute ten empeiria me ton ethopoio meso mias monopleures allelographias mazi tou, me tis epistoles tou na exelissontai se emerologio apokaluptiko tes sugkinetikes prospatheias enos anthropou na entakhthei sto koinoniko sunolo.
Enas ekptotos alkoolikos iereas, mia neare bibliothekarios kai o athurostomos aderphos tes tha sunthesoun mia asunethiste parea pou tha boethesei ton Mpartholomiou sto taxidi tes pragmatikes enelikioses tou."�
�Grammeno apo enan aparamillo stilista, philo kai sunodoiporo tou Mporkhes stis magikes periplaneseis sta pio ekthambotika topia tou phantastikou, auto to klasiko muthistorema epistemonikes phantasias tou 20ou aiona epanakuklophorei apo tis Ekdoseis Patake se nea metaphrase, panta sphrigelo kai erethistiko, panta anesukho kai anesukhetiko, panta diereunetiko kai axioperiergo.
Sunduazontas tis kaluteres tekhnikes tes agglosaxonikes paradoses tes logotekhnias musteriou kai tou phantastikou (Kh. Tz. Ouels, Tsesterton k.a.), o Kasares demiourgei ena muthistorema opou e uparxiake agonia tou aphegete metakulietai entekhna ston anagnoste, me mia epidexia, "diabrotike" graphe pou xerei pos na klimakonei ten entase, pos na puknonei to musterio gia na to dialusei kalutera, kai, kurios, pos na buthisei ton anagnoste se mia seira sullogismous gia ten upostase kai te moira tou anthropou.
Grammene to 1940, "E epheurese tou Morel" mporei na diabastei san ena sunarpastiko thriler, alla kai san khresmos: propheteuei me dramatike dioratikoteta te semerine kuriarkhia tou optikoakoustikou, ten upotage ton ideon sten pantodunamia tes eikonas."�
�"Khasame tis douleies mas, khasame ta spitia mas, khasame te zoe mas - giati na me khasoume kai te mneme mas; Giati; Giati mas peran ola t' alla kai mas aphesan te mneme; Giati den ten arpaxan ki aute;"
To "Kalo tha 'rthei apo te thalassa" einai to proto meros mias trilogias diegematon gia tous emphulious pou diexagontai s' ena nesi tou Aigaiou. E Arteme kai o Stauros, pou petane khartaeto ton Ioulio, pano sta apokaIdia enos kamenou oneirou, o Khrones sto karotsi, pou polemaei me zontanous kai anastemenous ephialtes, o Tasos, pou khanetai khoreuontas exo apo mia spelia, o Lazaros to Toxo, pou to stoma tou agapaei to onoma tou giou tou: ta prosopa pou protagonistoun einai esoterikoi metanastes - anthropoi, delade, pou ta teleutaia khronia egkateleipsan anagkastika ten Athena e alles megales poleis kai egkatastathekan sto nesi, paleuontas na stathoun xana orthioi, na xephugoun apo ena parelthon pou allazei diarkos kai ena mellon pou moiazei adiexodo gia olous. Sten prospatheia tous aute tha brethoun antimetopoi me tous ntopious katoikous, aphiloxenous apenanti stous "xenompates", tha thesoun se dokimasia tis metaxu tous skheseis, tha anametrethoun me ta phantasmata tou khthes, alla kai me ton phobo kai ten agonia gia to aurio. Anthropoi san kommenes gephures, pou agonizontai na phtiaxoun apo ten arkhe ton eauto tous, te zoe tous, mia nea khora, mia nea piste, enan kainourgio kosmo. Giati e arkhe den einai pote piso mas. E arkhe einai panta mprosta mas. (Apo ten parousiase sto opisthophullo tou bibliou)"�
�
Stis 28 Dekembre tou 2008, stis treis ta kharamata, o megaluteros phobos mou egine pragmatikoteta: kata to koinos legomenon, trelatheka.
To mualo mou - o kosmos mou - gkremisteke, kai te these tou pere mia pantoduname psukhose, pou san parasito me xeniste ton idio mou ton eauto, trephotan kai therieue me tis paranoikes idees pou gennouse astamateta: emoun o neos Dalai Lama, o Phulakas ste sikale, pleromenoi dolophonoi paramoneuan sto katopi mou.
S' auto mou to paralerema, olozontano akoma ste mneme mou, ste suntome noseleia mou, kai sten katopine, thanatere mou katathlipse, paresura ki odegesa sten apognose olous tous anthropous tes kardias mou, pou m' eblepan axaphna katakermatismeno apo mian anexelegkte psukhike astheneia.
O zopheros Dekembres tou '08 ste moudiasmene Athena. To iero kokkino khroma. Ki e autokheiras mana mou, pou khronia meta epistrephei apo ton Ade.
Sto biblio auto egrapsa ola osa thumamai, khoris n' allaxo tipota, kai men kratontas tipota krupho. Giati khare s' autes tis adianoetes meres, kataphera, mes sta suntrimmia tou mualou mou, na bro enan neo eauto, kai ton duskolo dromo pou odegei sten psukhike galene.
Ki eno e istoria mou moiazei monadike, to teras tes psukhikes arrostias kai tou phobou pou skorpaei einai koino gia olous mas, opos kai to therio tes agapes, kai tes kathe anthropines dunames.
Giati e psukhe mas den einai phtiagmene n' arkeitai ste dustukhia."	333333@"	=
